  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:350px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-silver pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Property Absorption</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/9/97/Absorbing_Man_5.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20140125144044\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Absorbing Man 5\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/9/97/Absorbing_Man_5.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20140125144044\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/9/97/Absorbing_Man_5.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20140125144044 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/9/97/Absorbing_Man_5.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1032?cb=20140125144044 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Absorbing Man 5\" width=\"270\" height=\"335\" data-image-key=\"Absorbing_Man_5.jpg\" data-image-name=\"Absorbing Man 5.jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Absorbing Man (Marvel Comics)</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Absorb properties</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The power to <b>absorb the properties from matter/energy/concepts</b>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Absorption\" title=\"Absorption\">Absorption</a>. Not to be confused with <a href=\"/wiki/Matter_Absorption\" title=\"Matter Absorption\">Matter Absorption</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Property_Replication\" title=\"Property Replication\">Property Replication</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Limitation\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitation</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Videos\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Videos</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FProperty_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Attribute Absorption/Imitation</li>\n<li>Elemental Imitation</li>\n<li>Externa (<i>The Lorien Legacies</i>)</li>\n<li>Matter Imitation</li>\n<li>Materical Imitation</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FProperty_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Users can absorb the properties of matter/energy/concepts without transforming into them. Depending of the user’s skill with the ability, they may absorb several elemental/material/conceptual properties at once.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FProperty_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorbing_Replication\" title=\"Absorbing Replication\">Imitate</a> the properties of <a href=\"/wiki/Matter_Absorption\" title=\"Matter Absorption\">matter</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Energy Absorption\">energy</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Concept_Absorption\" title=\"Concept Absorption\">concepts</a> of <a href=\"/wiki/Artificial_Element_Mimicry\" title=\"Artificial Element Mimicry\">Artificial Element Mimicry</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Mimicry\" title=\"Elemental Mimicry\">Elemental Mimicry</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Organic_Mimicry\" title=\"Organic Mimicry\">Organic Mimicry</a>.\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Property_Replication\" title=\"Property Replication\">Replicate</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Property_Conglomeration\" title=\"Property Conglomeration\">conglomerate</a> materials absorbed into <a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Mixture\" title=\"Elemental Mixture\">new and useful</a> forms.</li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Structure_Merging\" title=\"Structure Merging\">Structure Merging</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Merging\" title=\"Elemental Merging\">Elemental Merging</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Solid_Merging\" title=\"Solid Merging\">Solid Merging</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FProperty_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption\" title=\"Absorption\">Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Property_Manipulation\" title=\"Property Manipulation\">Property Manipulation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitation\">Limitation</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FProperty_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Limited to user's body, not to what they wear.</li>\n<li>May gain the weaknesses of absorbed matter/energy/concepts.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Immunity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Absorption Immunity\">Absorption Immunity</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Negation\" title=\"Absorption Negation\">Absorption Negation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FProperty_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Percival Edmund Chang/Grunge (Gen 13/Wildstorm Comics)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://marvel.fandom.com/wiki/Carl_Creel_(Earth-616)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:marvel:Carl Creel (Earth-616)\">Carl Creel/Absorbing Man</a> (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Jerry Sledge/Stonewall (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Kamal el-Alaoui (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>David Banner (<i>Hulk</i>)</li>\n<li>Kevin Levin (<i>Ben 10 Series</i>)</li>\n<li>Moryomaru (<i>Inuyasha</i>)</li>\n<li>Nagare (<i>Naruto</i>)</li>\n<li>Sydney Drew (<i>Power Rangers S.P.D.</i>)</li>\n<li>Yooka (<i>Yooka-Laylee</i>)</li>\n<li>Number Five (<i>Lorien Legacies</i>)</li>\n<li>White Monster (<i>Teen Titans</i>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FProperty_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D7&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"0a4236190615b10b375